  partName: Sensor
  description: The Sensor is a tiny, compact component located at the top-left-center
    of the engine, responsible for monitoring various engine parameters such as temperature,
    pressure, or airflow. Constructed from Material.001, its small size and strategic
    location allow it to accurately detect and transmit critical engine data. Interestingly,
    the Sensor's design features advanced sensing technologies and algorithms to
    provide precise and reliable readings.
